        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Roberto Martínez Rípodas, Tiko\n- Organizations: CD Basconia\n- Roles: footballer, central midfielder, defensive midfielder, assistant manager\n- Places: Estadio de López Cortázar\n- Competitions: Tercera División – Group 4\n\nFacts:\n- Roberto Martínez Rípodas was born on 15 September 1976.\n- Roberto Martínez Rípodas is known as Tiko.\n- Tiko is a Spanish retired footballer.\n- Tiko played as a central midfielder and a defensive midfielder.\n- CD Basconia was founded in 1913.\n- CD Basconia currently plays in Tercera División – Group 4.\n- Tiko is the current assistant manager of CD Basconia.\n- CD Basconia holds its home games at Estadio de López Cortázar, which has a capacity of 8,500 seats.",
